"description":"Finding a caregiver job is easier than ever with Care.com. Discover thousands of opportunities in child care, senior care, housekeeping, pet care, and tutoring—all in one easy-to-use app designed to work for you.\n\nWhether being a caregiver is your career or you’re looking for part-time or occasional work, you can find lots of opportunities to earn on Care.com.\n\nStart today to join the 17 million caregivers (and counting) who have turned to Care.com. \n\n\nFIND JOBS THAT WORK FOR YOU\n•  Find meaningful work on your terms \n•  Explore lots of opportunities—from nannies and sitters to housekeeping, senior care, tutoring, pet care and more\n•  Work around your schedule—whether you’re looking for full-time, part-time, or the occasional gig\n\nTAKE CONTROL OF YOUR JOB SEARCH \n•  Set your own rate—so you know how much you can earn\n•  Search local job posts and apply directly through the app\n•  Get booking requests that match your availability\n\nSAFETY IS AT THE HEART OF OUR COMMUNITY\n•  Our team uses the latest technology to continually monitor job posts, messages, profiles, reviews, and more\n•  24/7 safety hotline available to address your questions and concerns \n•  Access tips and resources to support a safer job search\n\nMEMBERSHIP OPTIONS\n\nCaregivers can choose a Basic Membership or upgrade to a Premium Membership to get additional benefits—including being featured more prominently in search results, priority job alerts, waived screening fees, and more.\n\nPaid subscriptions will auto-renew for the same duration and price unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of your current term. You can cancel your subscription in your Apple Account Settings. \n\nReview our privacy policy at: \nhttp://www.care.com/privacy-policy-p1013.html \nReview terms of use at: \nhttp://www.care.com/terms-or-use-p1012.html", "trackCensoredName":"Care.com Caregiver: Find Jobs", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/care-com-caregiver-find-jobs/id1