"description":"HHAeXchange+ is the caregiver mobile app by HHAeXchange designed to support caregivers and their clients. \nFrom the first clock-in of the day to the last recorded visit note, HHAeXchange+ makes it easier to deliver high-quality care while staying organized, EVV compliant, and connected. \n\nWith HHAeXchange+, you can:  \n\n-- Clock in and out quickly with secure, configurable GPS \n-- View your schedule and visit details all in one place \n-- Record plan of care tasks and track goals without paperwork  \n-- Capture visit notes your way – by typing, voice recordings, or photos \n-- Communicate with your agency through real-time chat \n-- Stay productive offline. Your work syncs automatically when you’re back online  \n-- Monitor member progress proactively and improve outcomes with Care Insights \n\nWhether you’re helping with daily activities, documenting skilled visits, or keeping families informed, HHAeXchange+ helps you focus on what matters most: caring for your clients.", "trackCensoredName":"HHAeXchange+", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/hhaexchange/id1623129489?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.3371700000000004138200893066823482513427734375, "sellerUrl":"https://www.hhaexchange.com/solutions/caregivers", "languageCodesISO2A":["SQ", "AR", "HY", "BN", "MY", "KM", "HR", "EN", "FR", "GU", "HT", "HI", "KO", "PL", "PT", "RU", "SR", "ZH", "SO", "ES", "TH", "ZH", "UZ", "VI"], "fileSizeBytes":"95058944", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1302, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.3371700000000004138200893066823482513427734375, "userRatingCount":1302}, 
